{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesYLnmJLhcThYF1U6zi9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. The command output shows:\n- **Result**: BUILD SUCCESS\n- **Tests run**: 18 total (10 ShipmentControllerTest tests: 5 existing + 5 new)\n- **Failures**: 0\n- **Errors**: 0\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — ./mvnw test returned BUILD SUCCESS with all tests passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests all passed; no regressions\n3. ✅ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms and persists** — Test \"persists confirmed shipment to repository\" verifies round-trip: create → confirm → get returns CONFIRMED\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent** — Uses ApiException subclasses (ResourceNotFoundException for 404, ConflictException for 409) with ErrorCode enum, matching create endpoint pattern\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled refused; unknown refused** — Three separate test cases:\n   - \"idempotently confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment\" (succeeds)\n   - \"rejects confirmation of a CANCELLED shipment with 409 conflict\" (409)\n   - \"rejects confirmation of non-existent shipment with 404 not found\" (404)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only modified .kt files; pom.xml untouched\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified ShipmentController.kt and ApiError.kt, both directly required by the feature\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added SHIPMENT_ALREADY_CANCELLED to ErrorCode enum (1 line added). Necessary because ConflictException requires an error code from this enum for the 409 response when confirming a cancelled shipment.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added confirm() method (21 lines). Implementation:\n   - Throws ResourceNotFoundException if shipment not found (404)\n   - Throws ConflictException if status is CA